{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Time Ribbon 是一款視覺化世界時鐘，把全球多地時間化成一條可滑動的時間緞帶，讓你一眼看清各地此刻的時間、日期與日光狀態。無論是協調跨國團隊、致電海外親友，還是外遊時想確認當地時間，都相當合用。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>拉動時間緞帶掌握全球時差</h2>\n<p>只需左右拉動時間緞帶，所有地點便會同步移動，直接顯示當地時間、日期，以及日光、暮光與黑夜的變化。你可以跳至指定當地時間或時區偏移，快速找出跨國會議與通話的合適時段，並由選定的時刻直接建立會議。緞帶可加入名稱、旗幟、圖像與彩色符號，重要地點可保持顯示，另支援桌面小工具及淺色、深色模式。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-42-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-43-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-44-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-45-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-46-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-47-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Time Ribbon</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-05T06:13:53.553083+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":323,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}